OL,3,GNEWSAMissing German WW2 U-boat found 82
OL,4,Ayears on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA German submarine that went missing
OL,7,Fduring World War Two after being
OL,8,Fdamaged by the Royal Navy has been
OL,9,Fdiscovered 82 years on.
OL,11,FPlymouth dive team Gasperados
OL,12,Fidentified the U-672 about 20 miles
OL,13,F(32km) off Salcombe, Devon, after it
OL,14,Fwas discovered by a deep sea diving
OL,15,Fteam from Portland in August at a depth
OL,16,Fof about 230ft (70m).
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34602
SC,0002
