OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1792562225
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAMissing German WW2 U-boat found 82
OL,4,Ayears on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vessel was attacked by HMS Balfour
OL,7,Fin July 1944 but was scuttled by its 52
OL,8,Fcrew - all of whom survived. A navy log
OL,9,Fshowing the sinking had incorrect
OL,10,Fcoordinates, resulting in it not being
OL,11,Ffound until recently.
OL,13,FMembers of Gasperados said they were
OL,14,F"really pleased" they could help
OL,15,Fidentify the vessel.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
